# What the web image build (Dockerfile) may see. Allow-list: everything is
# left out unless listed below, so a new file (or a real .env) can't slip in.
# That already excludes .env*, node_modules, .git, .next, worker/, tests/,
# e2e/, test-results/, logs, *.md and .env.example (the build doesn't need it).
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!next.config.ts
!tsconfig.json
!src
!public

# Never secrets or junk, even if one ends up inside src/ or public/.
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/node_modules
**/*.log
**/*.md
